tasks.json contains 48 task definitions selected without semantic modification
from assets/dataset/webarena-verified.json. Browserrig selected and reformatted
this subset; the task IDs, instructions, revisions and evaluation rules are
unchanged. manifest.json records selection and provenance.

local-v2/tasks.json and local-v3/tasks.json are separately versioned,
infrastructure-conditioned subsets.
It retains 43 original definitions and replaces the five Map/Wikipedia-dependent
tasks with unmodified Hard tasks on Shopping, Shopping Admin, GitLab and Reddit.
Their manifests record the parent checksum, deterministic selection seed,
replacement mapping and provenance. Local-v3 also records narrow static evaluator
consistency screens; local-v2 is retained as the initial pilot. The same source
license and citation apply.

